1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,607
Kenapa sih hape kamu makin lemot pas memorinya hampir penuh?

2
00:00:03,697 --> 00:00:05,847
Di dalam chipnya ada blok-blok,

3
00:00:05,777 --> 00:00:08,327
tiap blok punya banyak halaman kecil.

4
00:00:08,417 --> 00:00:10,167
Data ditulis per halaman,

5
00:00:10,057 --> 00:00:12,967
tapi halaman yang terisi nggak bisa ditimpa.

6
00:00:12,897 --> 00:00:16,487
Harus dihapus dulu, dan hapusnya satu blok sekaligus.

7
00:00:16,857 --> 00:00:20,087
Nah, pas hampir penuh, halaman kosongnya habis.

8
00:00:19,977 --> 00:00:24,647
Jadi buat nyimpan satu foto, hape harus mindahin data yang masih dipakai.

9
00:00:24,577 --> 00:00:27,687
Terus blok lamanya dihapus, baru fotonya masuk.

10
00:00:27,617 --> 00:00:31,447
Makin penuh, makin sering kerja ekstra ini, makanya lemot.

11
00:00:31,337 --> 00:00:34,487
Belum lagi, ruang buat file sementara ikut sempit.

12
00:00:34,417 --> 00:00:37,207
Padahal kalau lega, fotonya langsung masuk.

13
00:00:37,097 --> 00:00:41,607
Jadi sisakan ruang kosong, paling nggak sepuluh persen, biar tetap ngebut.
